    IDS_PSD_DISCLAIMER_FULL "The plugins in this store are developed by independent authors, such as employees, partners or other developers. They are not part of Tungsten Power PDF and are not official Tungsten Automation products; the automatic checks and the review before release do not constitute a warranty.\n\nThey are provided as is, without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including fitness for a particular purpose, availability or freedom from errors.\n\nThere is no official support through Tungsten Automation Support. Please contact the author named in the catalog; answers are voluntary and without guaranteed response times.\n\nTo the extent permitted by law, Tungsten Automation accepts no liability for damage, data loss or downtime caused by installing or using these plugins. Each plugin is the responsibility of its author.\n\nTest plugins before productive use, keep backups of important documents, and make sure their use complies with your organization's IT and data protection policies."
    IDS_PSD_BTN_DISCLAIMER "Disclaimer"
    IDS_PSD_ASK_RESTART "'%s' is installed. Power PDF loads plugins at start.\n\nRestart Power PDF now? Unsaved documents are offered for saving first."
    IDS_PSD_ASK_RESTART_UN "'%s' is removed. Power PDF unloads it at the next start.\n\nRestart Power PDF now? Unsaved documents are offered for saving first."
    IDS_PSD_ASK_SELFUPD "Power PDF closes for the update, the new Add-on Store is installed and Power PDF starts again on its own. Unsaved documents are offered for saving first.\n\nUpdate now?"
